an class=\"name\">URI</span>.<span class=\"name\">Origin</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The web origin of an HTTP connection: the (scheme, host, port) triple that\nidentifies where a connection is established, per RFC 6454.\n\nTwo `Origin` values are equal when all three components match, which is the\nstandard same-origin check used for redirect and credential decisions.","docLink":"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.html#Std.Http.URI.Origin","kind":"structure","line":926,"name":"Std.Http.URI.Origin","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.lean#L926-L949"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.html#Std.Http.URI.normalize\"><span class=\"name\">Std</span>.<span class=\"name\">Http</span>.<span class=\"name\">URI</span>.<span class=\"name\">normalize</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">uri</span> : <a href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.html#Std.Http.URI\">URI</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.html#Std.Http.URI\">URI</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Partially normalizes a URI by removing dot-segments from the path (`.` and `..`)\naccording to RFC 3986 Section 5.2.4.\n\nThis does not apply the full normalization set from RFC 3986 Section 6 — for example,\ncase normalization, percent-encoding normalization, and default-port normalization are\nnot performed.","docLink":"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.html#Std.Http.URI.normalize","kind":"def","line":913,"name":"Std.Http.URI.normalize","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.lean#L913-L922"}},{"header":"<div 