f</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.html#Std.Http.URI.Query\"><span class=\"name\">Std</span>.<span class=\"name\">Http</span>.<span class=\"name\">URI</span>.<span class=\"name\">Query</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Query string represented as an array of key-value pairs. Both keys and values are stored as\n`EncodedQueryParam` for proper application/x-www-form-urlencoded encoding. Values are optional to\nsupport parameters without values (e.g., \"?flag\"). Order is preserved based on insertion order.\n\nReference: https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc3986.html#section-3.4","docLink":"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.html#Std.Http.URI.Query","kind":"def","line":449,"name":"Std.Http.URI.Query","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.lean#L449-L458"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.html#Std.Http.URI.Path.toDecodedSegments\"><span class=\"name\">Std</span>.<span class=\"name\">Http</span>.<span class=\"name\">URI</span>.<span class=\"name\">Path</span>.<span class=\"name\">toDecodedSegments</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">p</span> : <a href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.html#Std.Http.URI.Path\">Path</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#String\">String</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Returns the path segments as decoded strings.\nSegments that cannot be decoded as UTF-8 are returned as their raw encoded form.","docLink":"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.html#Std.Http.URI.Path.toDecodedSegments","kind":"def","line":439,"name":"Std.Http.URI.Path.toDecodedSegments","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.lean#L439-L445"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.html#Std.Http.URI.Path.normalize\"><span class=\"name\">Std</span>.<span class=\"name\">Http</span>.<span class=\"name\">URI</span>.<span class=\"name\">Path</span>.<span class=\"name\">normalize</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">p</span> : <a href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.html#Std.Http.URI.Path\">Path</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.html#Std.Http.URI.Path\">Path</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Removes dot segments from the path according to RFC 3986 Section 5.2.4. This handles \".\"\n(current directory) and \"..\" (parent directory) segments.","docLink":"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.html#Std.Http.URI.Path.normalize","kind":"def","line":414,"name":"Std.Http.URI.Path.normalize","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.lean#L414-L437"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.html#Std.Http.URI.Path.appendEncoded\"><span class=\"name\">Std</span>.<span class=\"name\">Http</span>.<span class=\"name\">URI</span>.<span class=\"name\">Path</span>.<span class=\"name\">appendEncoded</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">p</span> : <a href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.html#Std.Http.URI.Path\">Path</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">segment</span> : <a href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Encoding.html#Std.Http.URI.EncodedSegment\">EncodedSegment</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.html#Std.Http.URI.Path\">Path</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Appends an already-encoded segment to the path.","docLink":"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.html#Std.Http.URI.Path.appendEncoded","kind":"def","line":408,"name":"Std.Http.URI.Path.appendEncoded","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.lean#L408-L412"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.html#Std.Http.URI.Path.append\"><span class=\"name\">Std</span>.<span class=\"name\">Http</span>.<span class=\"name\">URI</span>.<span class=\"name\">Path</span>.<span class=\"name\">append</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">p</span> : <a href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.html#Std.Http.URI.Path\">Path</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">segment</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#String\">String</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.html#Std.Http.URI.Path\">Path</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Appends a single segment to the path. The segment will be percent-encoded.","docLink":"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.html#Std.Http.URI.Path.append","kind":"def","line":402,"name":"Std.Http.URI.Path.append","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.lean#L402-L406"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.html#Std.Http.URI.Path.join\"><span class=\"name\">Std</span>.<span class=\"name\">Http</span>.<span class=\"name\">URI</span>.<span class=\"name\">Path</span>.<span class=\"name\">join</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">p1 </span><span class=\"fn\">p2</span> : <a href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.html#Std.Http.URI.Path\">Path</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.html#Std.Http.URI.Path\">Path</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Joins two paths. If the second path is absolute, it is returned as-is. Otherwise, the second path's\nsegments are appended to the first path.","docLink":"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.html#Std.Http.URI.Path.join","kind":"def","line":394,"name":"Std.Http.URI.Path.join","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.lean#L394-L400"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.html#Std.Http.URI.Path.parent\"><span class=\"name\">Std</span>.<span class=\"name\">Http</span>.<span class=\"name\">URI</span>.<span class=\"name\">Path</span>.<span class=\"name\">parent</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">p</span> : <a href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.html#Std.Http.URI.Path\">Path</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.html#Std.Http.URI.Path\">Path</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Returns the parent path by removing the last segment. If the path is empty, returns the path unchanged.","docLink":"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.html#Std.Http.URI.Path.parent","kind":"def","line":387,"name":"Std.Http.URI.Path.parent","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.lean#L387-L392"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.html#Std.Http.URI.Path.render\"><span class=\"name\">Std</span>.<span class=\"name\">Http</span>.<span class=\"name\">URI</span>.<span class=\"name\">Path</span>.<span class=\"name\">render</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">p</span> : <a href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.html#Std.Http.URI.Path\">Path</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hasAuthority </span><span class=\"fn\">hasScheme</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#String\">String</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Renders the path of a URI (`hasScheme`) or of a relative reference so that it reads back as the same\npath component (RFC 3986 §3.3, §4.2):\n* after an authority, a non-empty path starts with `/`, or it would extend the host;\n* without one, a path that would start with `//` is put behind a `/.` segment, or it would read as\n  an authority;\n* a relative path that starts with an empty segment, or, in a reference, with a segment containing\n  `:`, is put behind a `./` segment, or it would read as an absolute path or a scheme.\n\nThe `/.` and `./` segments disappear when dot segments are removed (RFC 3986 §5.2.4).","docLink":"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.html#Std.Http.URI.Path.render","kind":"def","line":363,"name":"Std.Http.URI.Path.render","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.lean#L363-L385"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.html#Std.Http.URI.Path.isEmpty\"><span class=\"name\">Std</span>.<span class=\"name\">Http</span>.<span class=\"name\">URI</span>.<span class=\"name\">Path</span>.<span class=\"name\">isEmpty</span></a> <