eme` from a string, normalizing to lowercase.\nReturns `none` if the scheme is invalid per RFC 3986 Section 3.1.","docLink":"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.html#Std.Http.URI.Scheme.ofString?","kind":"def","line":68,"name":"Std.Http.URI.Scheme.ofString?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.lean#L68-L78"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">instance</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.html#Std.Http.URI.instInhabitedScheme\"><span class=\"name\">Std</span>.<span class=\"name\">Http</span>.<span class=\"name\">URI</span>.<span class=\"name\">instInhabitedScheme</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Inhabited\">Inhabited</a> <a href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.html#Std.Http.URI.Scheme\">Scheme</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.html#Std.Http.URI.instInhabitedScheme","kind":"instance","line":63,"name":"Std.Http.URI.instInhabitedScheme","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.lean#L63-L64"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.html#Std.Http.URI.Scheme\"><span class=\"name\">Std</span>.<span class=\"name\">Http</span>.<span class=\"name\">URI</span>.<span class=\"name\">Scheme</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"URI scheme identifier (e.g., \"http\", \"https\", \"ftp\").","docLink":"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.html#Std.Http.URI.Scheme","kind":"def","line":58,"name":"Std.Http.URI.Scheme","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d8